{
  "resourceType": "Questionnaire",
  "id": "growth-monitoring",
  "url": "https://medplum.player.ohs.dev/fhir/Questionnaire/growth-monitoring",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": "GrowthMonitoring",
  "title": "Record growth",
  "status": "active",
  "date": "2026-09-21",
  "subjectType": [
    "Patient"
  ],
  "_comment": [
    "One visit's anthropometry, extracted as three separate vital-signs Observations rather than",
    "one with components -- that is how WHO growth data is queried (one code, one series) and it",
    "keeps each measurement independently omittable when a scale or tape is missing.",
    "LOINC: 29463-7 body weight, 8302-2 body height/length, 56072-2 MUAC. Units are UCUM.",
    "A blank measurement extracts NOTHING: templateExtractValue on an empty answer yields no",
    "occurrence, so a skipped field cannot become a zero reading.",
    "NOTE: no z-score or percentile is derived here. That needs the WHO reference tables and",
    "clinical sign-off; a wrong growth classification is worse than none."
  ],
  "extension": [
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-extractAllocateId",
      "valueString": "weightId"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-extractAllocateId",
      "valueString": "heightId"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-extractAllocateId",
      "valueString": "muacId"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-templateExtract",
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "template",
          "valueReference": {
            "reference": "#weight-template"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "resourceId",
          "valueString": "%weightId"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-templateExtract",
